<title>USA: IXC Communications names new CFO.</title>
<headline>IXC Communications names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>IXC Communications Inc said Tuesday it has appointed James Guthrie as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Guthrie, who is IXC's executive vice president, assumes this position in addition to his current responsibility for strategic planning, legal affairs and human resources.</p>
<p>He replaces John Willingham, who is retiring as senior vice president and chief financial officer, the company said.</p>
<p>IXC is a supplier of digital transmission and long distance services.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
